Neovarch Agent Desktop
======================

Neovarch Agent Desktop (this directory) is derived from Hermes Desktop by
Nous Research, part of the Hermes Agent project:

  https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent  (apps/desktop, apps/shared)
  Forked from upstream commit 61b7f957bac7fa25c7c22d54e4b215fa446e5331

Hermes Desktop is licensed under the MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2025 Nous Research. The full license text is in LICENSE and
applies to the derived code in this directory.

Changes made for Neovarch Agent include: product identity and naming,
icons, the default "Neovarch" theme preset, removal of the desktop usage
metrics offer, packaging targets (NSIS installer, zip, AppImage, tar.gz, deb)
and the release/update target (GitHub Releases of Maftuuh1922/neovrach_Agent).

Neovarch Agent still runs the Hermes Agent Python core (the `hermes` CLI and
gateway) from Nous Research as its runtime. "Hermes", "Hermes Agent",
"Hermes Cloud" and "Nous Portal" are names of Nous Research projects and
services; they are referenced only to describe that integration.
